WEBVTT

00:53:26.176 --> 00:53:30.180
basically tease out all the symptoms
and family history

00:53:30.204 --> 00:53:34.791
and use the AI engine to come up
with diagnosis and recommendations.

00:53:34.815 --> 00:53:37.014
And connect with the patient,

00:53:37.038 --> 00:53:41.609
get the patient to trust
his or her recommendations,

00:53:41.633 --> 00:53:43.403
visit a patient at home,

00:53:43.427 --> 00:53:45.895
spend a lot more time with the patient,

00:53:45.919 --> 00:53:47.799
thereby giving the patient

00:53:47.823 --> 00:53:51.680
the feeling that he or she
is being [looked] after,

00:53:51.704 --> 00:53:56.466
will both add a lot
to the health-care experience

00:53:56.490 --> 00:53:58.616
as well as the patient experience.

00:53:58.640 --> 00:54:01.004
CA: One thing I find
super hopeful about that